WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Widen CTA Button from 184 to 220 pixels.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.000
The wider button appears on the canvas.

00:09.000 --> 00:16.000
Switch to Code and inspect the same FNX document.

00:16.000 --> 00:24.000
Geometry and stable layer IDs are stored in the source.

00:24.000 --> 00:34.000
Select the brand label’s content.

00:34.000 --> 00:40.000
Change FANTA / STUDIO to FANTA / PUBLIC ALPHA.

00:40.000 --> 00:46.000
Save valid FNX, then return to the canvas.

00:46.000 --> 00:54.000
The canvas now shows your source edit.

00:54.000 --> 01:00.000
Later review of the same saved FNX.

01:00.000 --> 01:09.933
Git shows the brand-text and 184-to-220 width changes.
